<title>JAPAN: Sotoh Co plans to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Sotoh Co plans to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sotoh Co said on Friday that it was planning to buy back up to 1.7 million of its common shares at a cost not exceeding 2.0 billion yen.</p>
<p>The woolen fabrics firm, which is affiliated with Daidoh Ltd, said that the repurchase will be carried out after the plan is approved at a shareholders' meeting to be held on June 27.</p>
</text>
